XMLParser_XMLValidator :

XML Parser:
-----------

Reads (parses) the XML document.
Converts XML into a readable structure for programs.
Ensures the XML is well-formed (proper tags, nesting).
Examples: SAX Parser, DOM Parser.
Used for reading and processing XML.

XML Validator:
-------------
Checks if XML follows rules defined in XSD or DTD.
Ensures the XML is valid according to schema.
Verifies data types, required fields, structure.
Example: Validator using XSD file.
Used for checking correctness of XML before processing.

